    "title": "ProTool",
    "description": "ProTool by BimmerGeeks is an all-in-one solution for your BMW or Mini. We put the power of expensive shop equipment right in your hand using your android device...\r\n\r\nFxx/Gxx/Ixx coding and diagnostic support now available!\r\n\r\n- Read & Clear Errors across ALL control units\r\n- Thousands of code-able features to personalize your car\r\n- Code out errors from airbags to light warnings\r\n- Calibrate systems after replacing parts\r\n- Code and Register new batteries\r\n- View AND log live data in raw & gauge formats\r\n- Reset control units\r\n- Change ECU VIN numbers when swapping used parts\r\n\r\nCompatible Adapters:\r\n\r\n1) K-DCAN cable (For Fxx/Gxx/Ixx coding, only BimmerGeeks K-Dcan cables are permitted due to stability)\r\n2) Thor and MHD wifi adapters\r\n3) BimmerGeeks Bluetooth adapter\r\n4) Enet cable\r\n\r\nCheck for updates regularly!",
    "descriptionHTML": "ProTool by BimmerGeeks is an all-in-one solution for your BMW or Mini. We put the power of expensive shop equipment right in your hand using your android device...<br><br>Fxx/Gxx/Ixx coding and diagnostic support now available!<br><br>- Read &amp; Clear Errors across ALL control units<br>- Thousands of code-able features to personalize your car<br>- Code out errors from airbags to light warnings<br>- Calibrate systems after replacing parts<br>- Code and Register new batteries<br>- View AND log live data in raw &amp; gauge formats<br>- Reset control units<br>- Change ECU VIN numbers when swapping used parts<br><br>Compatible Adapters:<br><br>1) K-DCAN cable (For Fxx/Gxx/Ixx coding, only BimmerGeeks K-Dcan cables are permitted due to stability)<br>2) Thor and MHD wifi adapters<br>3) BimmerGeeks Bluetooth adapter<br>4) Enet cable<br><br>Check for updates regularly!",
